%% Figure 3.x  Sequence diagram - assess a loan  (paste into https://mermaid.live)
sequenceDiagram
    actor LO as Loan Officer
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as Backend API (FastAPI)
    participant SC as Scoring & Model
    participant DB as Database
    LO->>FE: enter loan & guarantors
    FE->>API: POST /assess-risk (JWT)
    API->>SC: assess(loan, guarantors)
    SC->>SC: build as-of features, predict, SHAP, adjust band
    SC-->>API: score, band, drivers, flags
    API-->>FE: risk result (JSON)
    FE-->>LO: gauge + plain-language explanation
    LO->>FE: save as application
    FE->>API: POST /applications
    API->>DB: INSERT application (assessed)
